cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the GHSL datasets it uses (see README)."
title: "degurba_world: Degree of Urbanisation for postcodes worldwide"
abstract: >-
  Python tool that assigns the Degree of Urbanisation (DEGURBA) to postcodes
  worldwide, at grid level (GHS-SMOD R2023A) and administrative-unit level
  (GHS-DUC R2023A on GADM 4.1), from the JRC Global Human Settlement Layer.
type: software
authors:
